  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a Strategic Plan to promote Waste-to Energy Solutions and Establish a Sustainable Waste-Supply-Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to promote sustainable waste to energy (WtE) solutions through a holistic value chain approach and will build national capacity and provide policy support in order to introduce WtE solutions in municipalities and localities throughout the country. The project seeks to strengthen institutional linkages, promote appropriate and localized technologies, develop sustainable waste value-chains, build human resource capacity, and promote Financial and Business Model for WtE solutions supported through an innovative financing mechanisms potentially including Public Private Partnerships (PPP). Further ,the activities will promote WtE solutions through adequate communication and awareness raising activities addressing different stakeholder groups.</narrative>
  </description>
